geous kingdom and sometimes travel around. \n\nもし可能でしたら、Xに投稿されていた背景付きのGIF作品のようなものをお願いしたいです。\nhttps://x.com/hidamarinemuri/status/1930485977740652865?s=46&t=2i1QTWRjnVJ2eLDNS_GPug\n\n[Profile]\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tI0fw3GdLCH71WL9dwQF1Uflv8pTIEIv\n\n参考にしていただけるようでしたら：\n\t1.\t二人でお城を散策しているシーン\n\t2.\t二人で冬の市街（ウィンター・マーケット）を楽しんでいるシーン\n\t3.\tその他、先生が合いそうだと感じたシチュエーション\n\nplease feel free to draw them based on the character information. Please feel free to draw something that matches the character descriptions!\nI’m excited to see your interpretation of the characters. \n\nYou can determine the clothes,pose and background. \nIf the amount is insufficient,please change the price. \nPlease feel free to cancel the request. \nPlease separate the signature into a different layer, thank you !", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@hidamarinemuri/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3643358, "client_id": 3606250, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e04f1041/uploads/origins/3717597f-e965-473a-b855-a122838f9722?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=121b326116c5939a2166ed1305ca9f09", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e04f1041/uploads/origins/3717597f-e965-473a-b855-a122838f9722?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=121b326116c5939a2166ed1305ca9f09, https://si.imgix.net/e04f1041/uploads/origins/3717597f-e965-473a-b855-a122838f9722?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6abeff9b6738626325296a8e0f76808a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e04f1041/uploads/origins/3717597f-e965-473a-b855-a122838f9722?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5453cc05a9c8a49645eebf9a23f6a0c3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e04f1041/u